 "shots": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 2.58,
   "dur": 2.58,
   "text": "Crispy on the outside,"
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "s": 2.58,
   "e": 4.62,
   "dur": 2.04,
   "text": "gooey in the middle. These"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "s": 4.62,
   "e": 6.67,
   "dur": 2.04,
   "text": "are the only chocolate chip cookies I make anymore."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "s": 6.67,
   "e": 8.71,
   "dur": 2.04,
   "text": "And there are three little"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "s": 8.71,
   "e": 10.75,
   "dur": 2.04,
   "text": "things that make them turn out like this every single"
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "s": 10.75,
   "e": 12.79,
   "dur": 2.04,
   "text": "time. Let's go."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "s": 12.79,
   "e": 18.79,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "text": "Here's everything you need. Butter, brown sugar, white sugar, one egg plus an extra yolk,"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "s": 18.79,
   "e": 23.46,
   "dur": 4.67,
   "text": "vanilla, flour, baking soda, salt, and way too much chocolate."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "s": 23.46,
   "e": 28.12,
   "dur": 4.67,
   "text": "Full amounts are on screen at the end, so don't write anything down."
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "s": 28.12,
   "e": 33.12,
   "dur": 5.0,
   "text": "Rule number one, brown your butter. Melt it on medium and just"
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "s": 33.12,
   "e": 38.12,
   "dur": 5.0,
   "text": "keep swirling. It'll foam up. Then go quiet and then"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "s": 38.12,
   "e": 44.12,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "text": "you'll see little golden brown bits at the bottom. Pull it right there and"
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "s": 44.12,
   "e": 54.12,
   "dur": 10.0,
   "text": "let it cool for 10 minutes so it doesn't scramble the eggs."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "s": 54.12,
   "e": 55.71,
   "dur": 1.58,
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "s": 55.71,
   "e": 60.71,
   "dur": 5.0,
   "text": "Both sugars into the butter, mostly brown. That's where the chewy comes from."
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "s": 60.71,
   "e": 65.71,
   "dur": 5.0,
   "text": "Whiskey the minute till it looks like caramel, then roll number two."
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "s": 65.71,
   "e": 69.71,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "text": "One whole egg and one extra yolk. That"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "s": 69.71,
   "e": 73.21,
   "dur": 3.5,
   "text": "yolk is the gooey center, vanilla, and"
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "s": 73.21,
   "e": 96.71,
   "dur": 23.5,
   "text": "whisk till it's glossy and thick. Flour, baking soda, salt, fold, don't beat. Just until you can't see dry flour. Overmixing is how you get tough cookies."
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "s": 96.71,
   "e": 101.71,
   "dur": 5.0,
   "text": "Now the chocolate. Half chips and half a chopped bar."
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "s": 101.71,
   "e": 110.71,
   "dur": 9.0,
   "text": "The chunks melt into puddles, the chips hold their shape. Fold it in."
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "s": 110.71,
   "e": 114.71,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "s": 114.71,
   "e": 116.29,
   "dur": 1.58,
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "s": 116.29,
   "e": 126.29,
   "dur": 10.0,
   "text": "Big scoops, like three tablespoons big, and rule number three. Chill them. 30 minutes minimum. Cold dough spreads slower."
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "s": 126.29,
   "e": 130.29,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "text": "Edges crisp, middle stays soft."
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "s": 130.29,
   "e": 133.29,
   "dur": 3.0,
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "s": 133.29,
   "e": 137.29,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "text": "Be 75, 10 to 12 minutes. Watch through the door,"
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "s": 137.29,
   "e": 141.29,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "text": "golden edges, and a middle that still looks a little underdone."
  },
  {
